# Lanhc CLI and daemon dependencies

The following open source dependencies are used to build the [lanhc][] and
[lanhcd][] commands. These are primarily used on Linux and BSD variants as
well as an [option for macOS][].

[lanhc]: https://pkg.go.dev/lanhc.com/cmd/lanhc
[lanhcd]: https://pkg.go.dev/lanhc.com/cmd/lanhcd
[option for macOS]: https://lanhc.com/kb/1065/macos-variants/

